cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "spanmark: segment-level localization of partially spoofed speech"
abstract: >-
  A two-route localizer for partially spoofed speech. A fine model scores every
  20 ms segment; a second model predicts 160 ms blocks natively rather than by
  pooling the fine stream. Segment EER 3.1788 at 160 ms over the full
  71,237-utterance PartialSpoof evaluation set.
authors:
